=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  sysctl routes ------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13$
# and Docker, which turned forwarding on: the host routes, so$
# Sending redirects and Reverse-path filter are left alone, and$
# say why. The other rows are set as on any host. Its values are$
# deb13-vm's: eth0 accepts IPv6 redirects though all and default$
# do not.$
$
# Kernel Settings ##############################################$
$
  [ ] Kernel Settings      Not Configured 4 to set$
$
  Network ------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] ICMP redirects       1 accepted, hardn sets 0$
  [ ] IPv6 redirects       1 accepted, hardn sets 0$
  [+] Source routing       0 refused$
  [+] SYN cookies          1 on$
  [+] Broadcast pings      1 ignored$
  [+] Bogus ICMP errors    1 ignored$
   -  Sending redirects    1 on, left alone: this host routes$
   -  Reverse-path filter  2 loose, left alone: this host routes$
   -  Forwarding           1 on: this host routes$
$
  Kernel -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Kernel addresses     0 shown to users, hardn sets 1$
  [+] Kernel log           1 root only$
  [+] Address randomizing  2 full$
  [ ] Process tracing      0 unrestricted, hardn sets 1$
  [+] Unprivileged BPF     2 off$
  [+] Performance events   3 limited$
$
  Files --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Hard links           1 protected$
  [+] Symbolic links       1 protected$
  [+] FIFOs in /tmp        1 protected$
  [+] Files in /tmp        2 protected$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply settings       Set 4 settings$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

